    "article_summary": "This article describes a scalable and mild continuous-flow strategy for the monofluoroalkylation of Giese acceptors using visible-light-mediated photoredox catalysis. By leveraging the transition-metal-free organic photocatalyst 4CzIPN, the authors generated secondary and tertiary monofluoroalkyl radicals from readily available \u03b1-monofluorocarboxylic acids. The method demonstrates high functional group tolerance, applicability to late-stage functionalization of drug-like molecules, and extension to three-component radical-polar crossover transformations.",
